&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the job&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Explore how a next-generation AI architecture behaves from rack scale to data centre scale.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a Senior Systems Engineer, you will investigate a novel AI computing architecture under demanding real-world workloads. You will work on problems where answers aren&#39;t readily known, turning curiosity into measurable evidence.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will design experiments, benchmark representative AI workloads and explore how hardware components and software interact at scale. When behaviour is unexpected, you will turn this into new measurements.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Your work will help infrastructure engineers, architects and application specialists understand system behaviour, performance, scalability and reliability across the stack. You will also help develop tooling and automation to collect, analyse and visualise system metrics.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You do not need to be an AI expert. You will need strong judgement, curiosity and a clear preference for evidence over opinion. You will love this role if you are someone who takes initiative, questions assumptions and enjoys working in areas where the answers are not yet known.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The team and culture&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The System QA team is distributed across multiple locations. We work hard to stay connected and collaborate closely. Our daily team meetings feel more like a virtual coffee break than a formal status update with space to share ideas, ask questions, discuss discoveries and solve problems together.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We value trust, autonomy and openness, and we understand that great engineers don&#39;t all follow the same career path. What matters is the quality of your work, your curiosity, and your willingness to explore challenging problems.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will have regular 1:1s with your people manager where you will have the opportunity to discuss things that matter to you. You will have dedicated time each week to focus on your CPD. The technical lead will provide direction and help set priorities, but everyone in the team is there to support each other.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;One of our core principles is that we measure and report what we observe without trying to make results look better or worse than they are.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What we&#39;re looking for&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfortable using Python to write tests, automate tasks, analyse data or develop practical engineering tools.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong analytical and problem-solving skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A curiosity-driven approach to investigating complex systems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to explain technical findings clearly, using accurate and reproducible evidence.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Confidence to work independently, take responsibility and collaborate across engineering teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in some of the following would be valuable: AI workloads and benchmarking, systems architecture, parallel and distributed computing, automation, containers or modern orchestration infrastructure&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;While we have outlined a set of requirements, we value transferable skills and diverse experiences from different industries. We actively welcome applications from engineers to the profession through a returnship or after a career break.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Benefits&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Flexible working: Balance your work and personal life with greater flexibility&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Generous leave: Take time to rest, recharge and enjoy life outside of work&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Retirement planning support: Up to 5% matched pension&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Phantom equity: Share in Graphcore’s success&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Workplace experience: Enjoy thoughtfully designed office spaces for collaboration, with free food and an on-site barista to support your day&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Peace of mind protection: Income protection and life assurance to provide financial security for you and your loved ones&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Flexible benefits: Tailor your benefits package with a choice of additional options, including private medical insurance and dental cover&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Optional benefits: Dental cover, health cash plan, private medical insurance, cycle to work scheme, give as you earn&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We welcome people from all backgrounds and experiences and are committed to building an inclusive environment where everyone can do their best work.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re an equal opportunity employer and recognise that everyone brings different strengths and perspectives. If you need any adjustments during the interview process, just let us know - we’re happy to support you.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Sponsorship&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Applicants must have the legal right to work in the UK. Unfortunately, we are unable to provide visa sponsorship or support visa applications for this role.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Join the Team at Graphcore&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Graphcore is one of the world’s leading innovators in Artificial Intelligence compute. It is developing hardware, software and systems infrastructure that will unlock the next generation of AI breakthroughs and power the widespread adoption of AI solutions across every industry.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As part of the SoftBank Group, Graphcore is a member of an elite family of companies responsible for some of the world’s most transformative technologies. Together, they share a bold vision: to enable Artificial Super Intelligence and ensure its benefits are accessible to everyone.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Graphcore’s teams are drawn from diverse backgrounds and bring a broad range of skills and perspectives. A melting pot of AI research specialists, silicon designers, software engineers and systems architects, Graphcore brings together deep expertise to solve complex problems and deliver meaningful progress in AI compute.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you want to explore how complex AI systems really behave, we’d love to hear from you. Apply now to join the Systems Engineering team.&lt;/p&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk">Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Mirakl:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Founded in 2012, Mirakl has been at the forefront of marketplace innovation, empowering every business to compete in the platform economy.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Today, Mirakl’s operating system combines an enterprise marketplace solution (Mirakl Platform) that enables retailers and B2B organizations to launch, scale, and operate marketplaces and dropship, AI-powered multichannel selling (Mirakl Connect), retail media (Mirakl Ads) and an agentic commerce infrastructure (Mirakl Nexus).&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;With dual headquarters in Boston and Paris, Mirakl helps a global ecosystem of 450+ marketplaces (B2C and B2B) and a network of over 100k third-party marketplace sellers. Brands like Macy’s, Decathlon, Carrefour, Asos, and Airbus Helicopters use Mirakl to grow their businesses in new and remarkable ways.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;For more information: &lt;a href=&quot;http://www.mirakl.com&quot;&gt;www.mirakl.com&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Mirakl in Numbers:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;🗓️ Founded in 2012 | Member of French Tech Next40&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;👥 750+ employees in 9 offices worldwide: Paris, Barcelona, Bordeaux, Boston, London, Munich, New York, Sydney, Tokyo&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;🇫🇷 350+ Mirakl Tech teams members mainly based in France&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;⚙️ 5 Saas Solutions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our Values:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Working at Mirakl means accelerating your career alongside ambitious, passionate, and supportive colleagues. We&#39;re proud of the diversity of backgrounds, perspectives, and experiences that make our teams unique.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our 5 values guide how we collaborate:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;💡&lt;strong&gt; Work Hard Together:&lt;/strong&gt; Teamwork and collaboration are the foundation of our success&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;🏆 &lt;strong&gt;Get Things Done: &lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;We prioritize action and efficiency for impactful results&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;🚀 &lt;strong&gt;Go Above &amp;amp; Beyond:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp; We tackle challenges proactively and always aim for excellence&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;🎓 &lt;strong&gt;Succeed Through Expertise:&lt;/strong&gt; Knowledge sharing and continuous learning are core to our culture&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;🤝 &lt;strong&gt;Satisfy &amp;amp; Empower Clients:&lt;/strong&gt; We&#39;re committed to our clients&#39; success&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the job&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Lead the design, development, and adoption of AI systems within a strategic business domain.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will combine deep AI engineering expertise with product and business understanding to identify high-impact opportunities, define roadmaps, and deliver measurable outcomes.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As the AI technical lead for your domain, you will drive architecture decisions, engineering excellence, and AI adoption across teams and stakeholders. Examples of domains include: Sales, GTM and Marketing or Finance &amp;amp; Legal&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a permanent position (CDI) based in Paris or Bordeaux, with &lt;strong&gt;4 days on-site per week&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;s-whitespace-pre-wrap s-break-words s-font-normal first:s-pt-0 last:s-pb-0 s-py-1 @md:s-pt-2 @md:s-pb-[10px] @md:s-leading-relaxed s-text-base s-leading-relaxed s-text-foreground dark:s-text-foreground-night&quot;&gt;&lt;strong class=&quot;s-font-semibold s-text-foreground dark:s-text-foreground-night&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Annual gross salary range (package): €90,000 – €100,000&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;s-whitespace-pre-wrap s-break-words s-font-normal first:s-pt-0 last:s-pb-0 s-py-1 @md:s-pt-2 @md:s-pb-[10px] @md:s-leading-relaxed s-text-base s-leading-relaxed s-text-foreground dark:s-text-foreground-night&quot;&gt;This range is provided for transparency purposes and reflects our internal compensation grid for this role level. The final offer will be determined based on your experience, skills, and the scope of responsibilities involved.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why Now, Why Mirakl&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Generative AI and AI Agents are fundamentally reshaping commerce software and the way our teams work on a day to day basis.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Mirakl, AI is becoming a core part of our product strategy. From Catalog Transformer and content generation to AI Agents and Agentic Commerce, we are building the next generation of commerce software. And we have the same ambition for our teams around AI products and adoption.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are looking for a &lt;span class=&quot;font-semibold text-foreground&quot;&gt;Principal AI Engineer&lt;/span&gt; to transform cutting-edge AI technologies into reliable, scalable, and measurable products used by leading enterprises worldwide.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You won&#39;t be joining a company that&#39;s thinking about AI. You&#39;ll be joining one that&#39;s already building it.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;What You’ll Do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;1. Own Tech Strategy for Your Domain&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify high-value opportunities with Business leaders&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Define the Tech vision and own the agent product roadmap for your domain&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;2. Lead AI System Development&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design and build production-grade AI systems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive architecture decisions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure scalability, reliability, and maintainability&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;3. Drive Adoption &amp;amp; Business Impact&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work closely with end users&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Measure adoption and outcomes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Accelerate AI transformation across your domain&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;4. Establish Technical Excellence&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Promote best practices for evaluation, testing, guardrails, and observability&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Review designs and mentor engineers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Raise the quality bar across initiatives&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;5. Grow AI Capability&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Mentor AI Engineers and Agent Builders&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Share knowledge and reusable components&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build AI expertise within your organization&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Success Metrics&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Business impact delivered by AI initiatives&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Adoption within the domain&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Technical quality and reliability&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Team capability growth&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our stack and tools&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Languages: &lt;/strong&gt;Python and SQL&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;AI Stack:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;OpenAI, Anthropic, Gemini, Mistral and Open-source models&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Agentic &amp;amp; Retrieval: &lt;/strong&gt;LangGraph, LangChain, LlamaIndex, MCP and Vector Databases&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Infrastructure: &lt;/strong&gt;AWS or GCP, Docker and Kubernetes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You&#39;ll Love This Job If you have&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;7+ years in Software Engineering, ML Engineering, or Applied AI&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong experience with LLMs, RAG, AI Agents, evaluation, and production systems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to influence Product and Business decisions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven leadership on complex cross-functional initiatives&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Feel free to add a link to your GitHub in your CV so we can understand what you have worked on!&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Want to join us? Here is our process&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A 30-40 min phone conversation with one of our Tech recruiters. This will be an opportunity to discuss your background, expectations, and discover what Mirakl can offer you in return.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;An initial 1 hour technical discussion with a member of the Data Science team and Engineering Team, which will allow you to delve into the more specific aspects of your expertise and discover how your skills can be integrated into our projects.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;2 x 45-minute &quot;STAR&quot; interviews with future Mirakl colleagues to discuss our values and company culture.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;We welcome collaborators with their diverse perspectives and experiences to power us forward. These often far exceed conventional job requirements and help us create a culture of continuous learning. If you’re ready to join a global leader powering digital transformation for 450+ of the world’s most innovative retailers and B2B organizations.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;As part of our recruitment process, Mirakl processes your personal data to review and manage your application and, where appropriate, to consider your profile for future opportunities. You can exercise your data protection rights at any time, and as further detailed in our policies. For more information about how we process your personal data and your rights, please consult our Recruitment Privacy Notice, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.mirakl.com/recruitment-privacy-notice&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;here&lt;/a&gt; in English and &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.mirakl.com/fr-FR/recruitment-privacy-notice&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;here&lt;/a&gt; in French.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;We may use Artificial Intelligence (AI) solutions to help streamline our hiring process, including screening applications, analyzing resumes, and assessing responses. While AI helps us work efficiently, all final hiring decisions are made by humans. For more information, visit our &lt;/em&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://info.mirakl.com/ai-guidelines-for-candidates-and-interviews&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;AI Guidelines for Candidates and Interviews&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;em&gt;.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.fr">Jobs in France</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who We Are&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;VML is a leading creative company that combines brand experience, customer experience, and commerce, creating connected brands&amp;nbsp;to drive growth. VML is celebrated for its innovative and award-winning human-first work for clients including AstraZeneca, Colgate-Palmolive, Dell, Ford, Microsoft, Nestlé, The Coca-Cola Company, and Wendy&#39;s. In 2026, VML was named&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;em&gt;Campaign’s&lt;/em&gt; Global Network of the Year and ranked #2 Creative Network of the Year at Cannes Lions. VML’s global network spans 55+ markets with principal offices in Buenos Aires, Kansas City, London, New York, São Paulo, Shanghai and Singapore.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;VML is part of &lt;a href=&quot;https://urldefense.com/v3/__http:/wpp.com/__;!!IfJP2Nwhk5Z0yJ43lA!L_cfT4E3gsmmDY1lVQTB6ihlfPeBl9X4sMM2KI6iWZYexC2nCeZ9oxgP9qvgbrqxIBpx82rGb_mWqh5F0zKxq5_dP7Y$&quot;&gt;WPP&lt;/a&gt;, the trusted growth partner for the world&#39;s leading brands. Powered by exceptional talent and our agentic marketing platform WPP Open, WPP unites cutting-edge media intelligence and data solutions, creativity, production, enterprise solutions and expert strategic counsel.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;For more information, please visit&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;a class=&quot;ms-outlook-linkify&quot; href=&quot;http://www.vml.com/&quot; data-outlook-id=&quot;fbec6e7f-765e-41de-af7b-a3ef743f9886&quot;&gt;&lt;u&gt;www.vml.com&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;u&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/u&gt;and follow along on  &lt;a href=&quot;https://urldefense.proofpoint.com/v2/url?u=https-3A__urldefense.com_v3_-5F-5Fhttps-3A_www.linkedin.com_company_vml_-5F-5F-3B-21-21JboVxjCXSME-21OhlpCfbkl1UcWPwns1-2DGtvHOzFh0QwHV49fsPgGw-2DVCCU1bCg8aQFI9vN-2Dy-2DVwaQcITH2j2XKzGKBIFRLYf2AUWVYY1dFGK6-24&amp;amp;d=DwMFaQ&amp;amp;c=euGZstcaTDllvimEN8b7jXrwqOf-v5A_CdpgnVfiiMM&amp;amp;r=zouFnm4jZMgDFaYF1uVcRY3rbgHWPca_luUrBUkT6Yc&amp;amp;m=QzcCgXCAOjzj5hiU48_CKOdHRSJ4_YpuqfviT9yjlzH5VrkzySTZ-WaQXlYAnj4W&amp;amp;s=jJ7q5V70u9oUx7ONPm5jC3IK8y6vxDilX6BGTlqlWlA&amp;amp;e=&quot; data-outlook-id=&quot;b89e4621-22a7-4a88-a5da-c6ecc3a722be&quot;&gt;&lt;u&gt;LinkedIn&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;#WeAreVML.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Senior Strategist&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;isSelectedEnd&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Company:&lt;/strong&gt; VML&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Working Model:&lt;/strong&gt; Hybrid working&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Location:&lt;/strong&gt; Sea Containers office, London, SE1&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;isSelectedEnd&quot;&gt;At VML, we are a beacon of innovation and growth in an ever-evolving world. Our heritage is built upon a century of combined expertise, where creativity meets technology, and diverse perspectives ignite inspiration. With the merger of VMLY&amp;amp;R and Wunderman Thompson, we have forged a new path as a growth partner that is part creative agency, part consultancy, and part technology powerhouse.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;isSelectedEnd&quot;&gt;Our global family now encompasses over 30,000 employees across 150+ offices in 64 markets, each contributing to a culture that values connection, belonging, and the power of differences. Our expertise spans the entire customer journey, building connected brands that drive growth for our clients. We do this by leveraging our three core practices: Brand Experience, Customer Experience and Commerce. Within these practices, we offer expertise across communications, commerce, consultancy, CRM, data, production and technology. We deliver end-to-end solutions that result in revolutionary work.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;The Role&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;isSelectedEnd&quot;&gt;As a &lt;strong&gt;Senior Strategist&lt;/strong&gt;, you&#39;ll be an important strategic voice within the team, working closely with Client Services, Creative, Data, Media and other specialist disciplines to turn business and customer challenges into clear, effective solutions.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;isSelectedEnd&quot;&gt;You&#39;ll work on one of our major Pan-European automotive accounts, helping develop strategy across the customer journey — from brand consideration and lead generation through to lifecycle CRM, digital experiences and retail activations.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;isSelectedEnd&quot;&gt;You&#39;ll be involved from brief through to delivery, using customer understanding, data, research and cultural insight to develop strong strategic thinking and give creative teams a clear direction. You&#39;ll also help ensure the work remains connected to the client&#39;s wider commercial objectives.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;isSelectedEnd&quot;&gt;This is a hands-on role, with the opportunity to take ownership of projects and workstreams while working closely with senior members of the strategy team. You&#39;ll have regular exposure to clients and will be expected to build trusted relationships, present your thinking confidently and contribute to conversations with stakeholders at different levels.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;isSelectedEnd&quot;&gt;There will also be opportunities to contribute to wider strategic projects, proactive thinking and new business, giving you the chance to bring your perspective to different challenges and develop your experience across the agency.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Key Responsibilities&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul data-spread=&quot;false&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop strategic thinking across projects and workstreams, from understanding the brief through to creative development, client sell-in and measuring effectiveness.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Turn business, customer, cultural and behavioural information into clear, actionable insights and strategic recommendations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop compelling strategic and creative briefs that give creative teams a clear direction and space to do their best work across CRM, digital, social, search and dealership assets.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support end-to-end CRM communications across Passenger and Commercial Vehicles, including automated and triggered reminders, such as maintenance, MOT and servicing, seasonal promotional campaigns and ad-hoc owner messaging.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop consideration and conversion activations for individual vehicle nameplates across UK and European markets, ensuring communications ladder seamlessly into wider global brand positioning.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribute to the development of digital servicing journeys, helping increase consideration for official servicing through effective content and customer experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Apply an understanding of modern search behaviour, including Generative Engine Optimisation (GEO) and LLM-ready content, to relevant communications and digital experiences.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work closely with Client Services, Creative, Data and Media partners to develop connected and effective solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build strong working relationships with clients and become a trusted and credible strategic partner.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Present strategic thinking and recommendations clearly and confidently to clients and internal stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Use data, research and customer understanding to inform recommendations and strengthen the work.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Challenge briefs and thinking constructively when there is an opportunity to make the work better.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribute to pitches, proactive strategic projects, quarterly thought leadership and opportunities to grow existing and new client relationships.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support more junior members of the strategy team, sharing knowledge and helping raise the quality of strategic output.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bring curiosity and new thinking into the team, keeping up with changes in culture, technology, customer behaviour and the wider industry.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Who You Are&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul data-spread=&quot;false&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strategically strong:&lt;/strong&gt; You can get to the heart of a problem, identify what really matters and turn it into a clear point of view.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Commercially minded:&lt;/strong&gt; You understand how strategic thinking connects to client business objectives, customer acquisition, lead generation and long-term retention.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Confident but collaborative:&lt;/strong&gt; You&#39;re comfortable presenting your thinking and contributing to senior conversations, while being open to challenge and different perspectives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;A strong communicator:&lt;/strong&gt; You can make complex thinking feel simple, whether you&#39;re presenting to a client or briefing a creative team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Customer curious:&lt;/strong&gt; You genuinely want to understand what makes people tick and how behaviours, needs and motivations can influence the work.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Low ego:&lt;/strong&gt; You care more about getting to the right answer than getting credit for having it. You enjoy working with different people and bringing the best out of those around you.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Adaptable:&lt;/strong&gt; You can move comfortably between different types of briefs, from brand and communications strategy to CRM journeys, digital experiences and retail activation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Culturally and technologically curious:&lt;/strong&gt; You&#39;re interested in what&#39;s happening in the world and know how to turn those observations into useful strategic thinking. You&#39;re also interested in emerging technology, AI, LLMs and evolving search behaviours.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;A team player:&lt;/strong&gt; You enjoy working alongside Client Services, Creative and specialist teams and understand that the best work rarely comes from one person working alone.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;What You&#39;ll Need&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul data-spread=&quot;false&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven experience working as a Strategist or Senior Strategist within an agency environment. Automotive, mobility or Pan-European client experience would be a strong advantage.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience developing strategic thinking from brief through to creative development and delivery.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong understanding of customer behaviour, customer journeys and how different communications and experiences work together.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience across some combination of brand, communications, CRM/lifecycle marketing, digital, social, search or customer experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Confidence presenting strategic thinking and recommendations to clients and internal stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The ability to interpret data and research and turn it into meaningful insight.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong written and verbal communication skills, with the ability to make complex information clear and compelling.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working collaboratively with Creative, Client Services, Data, Media or other specialist teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience contributing to pitches and/or proactive strategic projects would be beneficial.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience supporting or mentoring more junior team members would be advantageous.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;An understanding of modern search trends, AI, LLMs and Generative Engine Optimisation (GEO) would be beneficial.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;What Success Looks Like&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul data-spread=&quot;false&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strategic thinking that is clear, compelling and rooted in genuine customer and business insight.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work that gives creative teams a strong strategic foundation and a clear opportunity to respond to.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Clients who value your thinking and see you as a trusted strategic partner.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong collaboration across Strategy, Creative, Client Services and specialist teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strategic recommendations that contribute to meaningful client and business outcomes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The ability to take ownership of projects and move them forward with confidence.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A positive contribution to the development and quality of the wider strategy team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bringing clarity, curiosity and momentum to complex challenges.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;What&#39;s in It for You?&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul data-spread=&quot;false&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The opportunity to work on high-profile clients and commercially meaningful challenges.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The chance to work alongside talented people across Strategy, Creative, Client Services and specialist disciplines.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A genuinely collaborative environment where different perspectives are encouraged.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The opportunity to work across a broad range of strategic challenges and develop your experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A culture that values good thinking, curiosity, collaboration and people who aren&#39;t afraid to challenge the status quo.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong learning, development and career progression opportunities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A competitive package, hybrid working and access to the full suite of company and group benefits.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;normaltextrun&quot;&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;EN-GB&quot;&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;EN-GB&quot;&gt;We believe the best work happens when we&#39;re together, fostering creativity, collaboration, and connection. That&#39;s why we’ve adopted a hybrid approach, with teams in the office an average of four days a week. If you require accommodations or flexibility, please discuss this with the hiring team during the interview process.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;normaltextrun&quot;&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;EN-GB&quot;&gt;WPP (VML) is an equal opportunity employer and considers applicants for all positions without discrimination or regard to characteristics. We are committed to fostering a culture of respect in which everyone feels they belong and has the same opportunities to progress in their careers.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;scxw176048299&quot;&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;EN-GB&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;When you click &quot;Submit Application&quot;, this will send any information you add below to VML. Before you do this, we think it&#39;s a good idea to read through our&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.vml.com/recruitment-privacy-policy&quot;&gt;Recruitment Privacy Policy&lt;/a&gt;. California residents should read our&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.vml.com/california-recruitment-privacy-notice&quot;&gt;California Recruitment Privacy Notice&lt;/a&gt;. This explains what we do with your personal data when you apply for a role with us, and, how you can update the information you have provided us with or how to remove it.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;At Anaplan, we are a team of innovators focused on optimizing business decision-making through our leading AI-infused scenario planning and analysis platform so our customers can outpace their competition and the market.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;What unites Anaplanners across teams and geographies is our collective commitment to our customers’ success and to our Winning Culture.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;padding-left: 40px;&quot;&gt;Our customers rank among the who’s who in the Fortune 50. Coca-Cola, LinkedIn, Adobe, LVMH and Bayer are just a few of the 2,400+ global companies who rely on our best-in-class platform.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;padding-left: 40px;&quot;&gt;Our Winning Culture is the engine that drives our teams of innovators. We champion diversity of thought and ideas, we behave like leaders regardless of title, we are committed to achieving ambitious goals, and we love celebrating&lt;em&gt; &lt;/em&gt;our wins – big and small.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Supported by operating principles of being strategy-led, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.anaplan.com/careers/&quot;&gt;values&lt;/a&gt;-based and disciplined in execution, you’ll be inspired, connected, developed and rewarded here. Everything that makes you unique is welcome; join us and let’s build what’s next - together!&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-markdown-start-index=&quot;509&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Role Overview&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-markdown-start-index=&quot;509&quot;&gt;We are looking for a&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-markdown-start-index=&quot;559&quot;&gt;Senior Solution Consultant to join our highly specialized European Supply Chain Pre-sales community. You will act as the technical and domain expert on high-stakes, high-impact enterprise opportunities, specifically focusing on strategic supply chain opportunities.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Reporting directly to the Director, Supply Chain Solution Consulting EMEA, you will demonstrate Anaplan&#39;s unique value proposition through customized Proof of Concept (POC) and flawless high-quality demonstrations.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-markdown-start-index=&quot;953&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;Your Impact&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-markdown-start-index=&quot;1472&quot;&gt;Targeted Enterprise Engagement:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-markdown-start-index=&quot;1505&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;Engage with large, strategic enterprise prospects in&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-markdown-start-index=&quot;1561&quot;&gt;France&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-markdown-start-index=&quot;1569&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;(and support growth in the wider Southern Europe/EMEA region), specifically targeting the&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-markdown-start-index=&quot;1662&quot;&gt;manufacturing and industrial sectors&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-markdown-start-index=&quot;1700&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;to identify complex, broken business planning processes and map them to Anaplan&#39;s capabilities.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-markdown-start-index=&quot;1802&quot;&gt;High-Value Solution Engineering:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-markdown-start-index=&quot;1836&quot;&gt; Design and build domain-specific, tailored Proof of Concept (POC) models and demonstrations that illustrate how Anaplan solves complex Supply Chain planning problems (S&amp;amp;OP, production planning, capacity constraints) and links them directly to financial outcomes.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-markdown-start-index=&quot;2329&quot;&gt;Collaborative Preparation:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-markdown-start-index=&quot;2357&quot;&gt; Work hand-in-hand with our local Principal Consultant and the wider European team of 7 Supply Chain experts (UK, Italy, France) to divide, conquer, and perfect high-stakes demos.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-markdown-start-index=&quot;2557&quot;&gt;Internal &amp;amp; External Stakeholder Management:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-markdown-start-index=&quot;2602&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;Deliver high-impact presentations and technical discussions with Supply Chain Directors, VP of Supply Chain, and C-Level executives, while cross-training and aligning with internal Sales, Product, and the Presales Center of Excellence (COE) teams.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;span data-markdown-start-index=&quot;509&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;Your Qualifications&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-markdown-start-index=&quot;2888&quot;&gt;Senior Domain Expertise:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-markdown-start-index=&quot;2920&quot;&gt; Several years of successful Pre-sales / Solution Consulting experience, with a deep specialization in Supply Chain planning (including S&amp;amp;OP, Supply Planning, and Production Planning).&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-markdown-start-index=&quot;3540&quot;&gt;Consultative &amp;amp; Methodical Approach:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-markdown-start-index=&quot;3577&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;Ability to take a consultative, value-driven selling approach by listening to customer needs, combined with a strong desire to &quot;get hands-on&quot; with model building and thorough demo preparation.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-markdown-start-index=&quot;3776&quot;&gt;Communication &amp;amp; Presentation Skills:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-markdown-start-index=&quot;3814&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;Exceptional communication skills with the ability to confidently present complex technical scenarios to both highly technical teams and C-suite stakeholders.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-markdown-start-index=&quot;3978&quot;&gt;Languages:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-markdown-start-index=&quot;3990&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;Fluent in&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-markdown-start-index=&quot;4003&quot;&gt;French&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-markdown-start-index=&quot;4011&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;and highly proficient in&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-markdown-start-index=&quot;4039&quot;&gt;English&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-markdown-start-index=&quot;4048&quot;&gt; as it&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-markdown-start-index=&quot;4070&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;is our standard for European team collaboration and internal communication).&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-markdown-start-index=&quot;4151&quot;&gt;Master’s degree in Business Administration, Engineering, Supply Chain Management, or equivalent strongly preferable.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-markdown-start-index=&quot;4278&quot;&gt;Strong plus&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-markdown-start-index=&quot;4300&quot;&gt;Prior hands-on experience with advanced Supply Chain Planning software&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-markdown-start-index=&quot;4446&quot;&gt;Experience with Enterprise Performance Management (EPM), Integrated Business Planning (IBP), or multi-dimensional planning tools.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-markdown-start-index=&quot;4446&quot;&gt;Manufacturing Sector Focus&lt;strong&gt;:&lt;/strong&gt; Proven track record of working with manufacturing and industrial accounts, understanding their specific operational realities, terms, and production planning challenges.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-markdown-start-index=&quot;4446&quot;&gt;Hands-on Technical Agility&lt;strong&gt;:&lt;/strong&gt; Strong multi-dimensional modelling skills and direct experience or comfortable familiarity with mathematical optimization engines/solvers (such as Gurobi, Simplex, or similar).&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-markdown-start-index=&quot;4685&quot;&gt;#LI-Remote&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our Commitment to Diversity, Equity, Inclusion and Belonging (DEIB) &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We believe attracting and retaining the best talent and fostering an inclusive culture strengthens our business. DEIB improves our workforce, enhances trust with our partners and customers, and drives business success. Build your career in a place where diversity, equity, inclusion and belonging aren’t just words on paper – this is what drives our innovation, it’s how we connect, and it contributes to what makes us a market leader. We believe in a hiring and working environment where all people are respected and valued, regardless of gender identity or expression, sexual orientation, religion, ethnicity, age, neurodiversity, disability status, citizenship, or any other aspect which makes people unique. We hire you for who you are, and we want you to bring your authentic self to work every day! &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We will ensure that individuals with disabilities are provided reasonable accommodation to participate in the job application or interview process, perform essential job functions, and receive equitable benefits and all privileges of employment. Please contact us to request accommodation. &amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Fraud Recruitment Disclaimer&lt;/strong&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;It has come to our attention that fraudulent and fictitious job opportunities are being circulated on the Internet. Prospective candidates are being contacted by certain individuals, mainly through telephone calls, emails and correspondence, claiming they are representatives of Anaplan. The main purpose of these correspondences and announcements is to obtain privileged information from individuals.  &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Anaplan does not: &amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
